    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσ-εύρετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to find out</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				816
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τό τινων γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.234
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hard to find</i> or <i>get</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.14.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπάνιον καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.97b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hard to find one's way through, impenetrable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1221
				</span></i>
			.</div>
